{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23680","headline":"有双鹤留在洛中忽见刘郎中依然鸣顾刘因爲鹤叹二篇寄予予以二绝句答之 一 · 白居易","name":"有双鹤留在洛中忽见刘郎中依然鸣顾刘因爲鹤叹二篇寄予予以二绝句答之 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辞乡远隔华亭水，逐我来栖缑岭云。\n惭媿稻粱长不饱，未曾回眼向鸡羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}